# (Space) and back+start: the combo fires at 2300 and pauses, which lets
# go of Space. A lets go of everything and is unplugged. It comes back
# with a new id and the same info, so it reconnects to its slot, still
# paused: its tap of south maps nothing. Its combo resumes at 5600, and
# then south holds Space again.
